WEBVTT

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.450
Hell and Heaven!

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:44.350
Curatio...

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:48.020
Teneritas, sectio...

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:51.400
...salus, coctura!

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:00.950
Professor...

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:04.330
I've collected a very intriguing sample from that Underground Chamber...

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:06.960
Ah, Volfogg, so you made it back safely!

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.000
Professor...

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:12.340
But that's...

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:15.510
The very substance that transforms humans into Zonders...

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:17.140
...Zonder Metal!

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:21.010
Analyze this sample, and we're sure to discover what the enemy's after!

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.480
So this is the spark that could threaten all of mankind...

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:27.980
I saw it with my own eyes.

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:31.150
The enemy was using the energy from the particle accelerator...

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:35.320
...to create some kind of Zonder Metal incubation plant.

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:39.370
In other words, this thing was actually created here on Earth?

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:41.160
Not to mention, they've been doing it in massive amounts.

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:47.830
It's hard to believe that something like this could turn into a robot...

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:50.000
You'd better not get too close!

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.210
Or else you'll get Zonderized, too!

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:53.800
You've got to be kidding me.

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:56.220
What a dreadful technology...

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.340
...this Zonder Metal!

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:02.220
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:05.120
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:12.020
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:16.120
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:22.840
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:27.120
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:32.040
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:35.960
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:38.760
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:42.520
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:47.520
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:50.690
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:53.230
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:56.360
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:59.320
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:03.400
Dividing Driver!

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:11.040
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:16.920
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:19.870
Our very own King of Braves!

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:23.760
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.890
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.850
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:31.190
Tomorrow

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:33.480
<i>Tomorrow</i>

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:40.860
HyoRyu, EnRyu, and GaoGaiGar have all been successfully docked.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:47.030
HyoRyu, EnRyu, stand by in vehicle mode to receive the sterilization beam.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:53.540
HyoRyu, EnRyu, after sterilization, start the damage assessment process.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:56.380
Power down your main nervous systems, please.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:57.750
Roger!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.170
HyoRyu, main nervous system off!

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:05.260
EnRyu, main nervous system off!

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.510
Now applying the sterilization beam... start!

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:21.530
Sterilization now in progress.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.580
Caution! Dry Flow now approaching!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:34.250
Cleaning process complete. Dropping surface temperature to 40 degrees.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:36.420
The Amphibious Armored Maintenance Vehicle...

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.210
...will now return to the GGG Bay Tower base station.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.050
Oh, I see...

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.380
My little Mamoru found somebody's wallet?

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:44.840
Yes, yes, that's all there is to it...

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:48.100
The police will see to it that he's escorted safely home.

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:50.770
Right, no reason to worry. Thank you.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:55.940
Amphibious Armored Maintenance Vehicle has entered docking mode.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.130
Do you have any idea why GaoGaiGar has managed to...

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:20.630
...escape being fused with the enemy robots?

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.590
No, can't say I've ever given it a thought...

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:26.970
Despite the fact they get a clear power boost when they fuse with machines...

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:29.260
...for some reason the Zonder Robos have never even tried to...

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:30.970
...absorb GaoGaiGar, HyoRyu or EnRyu!

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.930
And the secret is in the G-Stone!

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.980
As you know, the Mobile Unit's power sources are...

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:40.570
...absolutely dependent on the G-Stone acting as a catalyst.

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:44.610
And the composition of this Zonder Metal...

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.950
...is nearly 100% identical to that of the G-Stone!

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:49.620
Huh? The same as the Zonder Metal?

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:51.830
Professor, Major?

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:54.830
We're starting the damage check on GaoGaiGar in the Maintenance Room.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:05.970
He really got ravaged, didn't he?

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.590
That's not battle-damage we're looking at.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:10.390
It's the effects of Hell and Heaven.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:11.600
Huh?

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:15.730
It works by supercharging both his destructive and protective power.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:17.520
With all that repeated use, it's no wonder that...

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.020
...GaoGaiGar's sustained so much damage.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.320
It doesn't matter how durable he may be...

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:31.820
Doesn't it take a heavy toll on Gai to be exposed to all that energy?

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.580
It does, without a doubt.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.170
It's gotten pretty late.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:44.960
I'll bet they're worried about you.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:45.590
Yeah.

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.760
It should be okay, since Mr. Entohji already called my mom.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:51.010
Plus, my dad's working late tonight, she said.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.010
We're here, Mamoru!

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:57.890
Thanks!

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:03.440
Hey, Big Brother Gai, are you sure you're feeling okay...

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:06.030
...after that huge battle you just fought?

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.320
You better believe it!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:11.240
Hey, you're talking to the strongest steel cyborg known to mankind!

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:16.120
If he keeps going into battle like this, it won't be long before Gai's body...

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:23.540
I would never allow that to happen!

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:28.800
There's no need to worry! After all, Gai's not fighting his battles alone!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.840
Hmm, you're right.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.720
As long as those two are there to back him up...

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:35.760
I'm putting my faith in you, too!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.390
Our strong hearted Braves!

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.100
I'm home!

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:40.730
Hey, Dad!

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:44.730
What's this? Don't tell me you just got home now too, Mamoru?

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:46.270
Uh, well, yeah.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:48.940
What am I gonna do with you, you delinquent?

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:50.530
Hey, it's not like that!

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:51.900
I've been waiting for you!

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:52.950
Ta-da!

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:56.240
Guess what, they were holding a lottery at the shopping arcade today...

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:59.290
...and I won the top prize, a trip to Okinawa!

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.540
What? Okinawa?

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:02.920
Hey, nice going, honey!

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.750
That means we're spending our next holiday in Okinawa!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.800
Waha! For real?

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.920
For real, for real! Waha!

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.470
Waha!

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:45.880
To think that they actually destroyed my Zonder Plant...

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:50.880
You must waste no time in annihilating that black robot!

00:08:58.430 --> 00:08:59.850
Data output in progress.

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:03.140
The Triple-Decked Flying Carrier...

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:09.820
Seeing as its function is to transport the Mobile Unit as a flying fortress...

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.490
...it would not be feasible to arm it with weapons of destruction.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:15.280
More than half of its entire breadth is taken up by the Mirror Catapult...

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:19.530
...a system developed in order to expedite long-range deployment.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:21.330
The trajectory is calculated accurately after which...

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:24.290
...a mirror-coating is applied to the object to be deployed...

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.210
...and it is then launched by the force of repulsion.

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:31.960
In addition to the Mirror Catapult, a normal catapult is also installed.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:35.340
The only possibility would be to use Catapult No. 2.

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:37.220
I do not see any other way.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:42.060
Catapult No. 2 is being modified now because it's too dangerous, right?

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:46.060
Correct, but inevitably, the day will come when we will put it to use.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.230
Okay, then that's a no-go, too.

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.650
Next batch of data, now processing...

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:54.190
The Amphibious Armored Maintenance Vehicle.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:59.570
A fortress designed to serve as the Mobile Unit's mobile...

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:00.570
...maintenance room.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:03.370
As it is more or less a hospital for robots...

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:05.540
...I'd have to say that it wouldn't be appropriate, either.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.290
All right. What's next?

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.210
The Ultra Technology Laboratory.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:14.130
A mobile lab equipped with an Ul-Tech Engine.

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:16.470
At the moment, it is being used by Dr. Shishioh...

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:18.550
...for Zonder analysis and is operating at full capacity.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.640
Because it is a highly classified area...

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:23.220
...it cannot be launched except in times of dire emergency.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:24.390
No good, huh?

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.560
That said, the Ul-Tech Engine is certain to be of use in the future.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:29.020
All right.

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:30.900
But what we need right now...

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:32.820
...is a fortress that can be modified right away.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:35.070
Continuing to process data...

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:41.990
The Landing and Supply Assault Ship.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:46.080
Designed for transporting a diverse array of materials, as well as fuel...

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.410
...it is therefore equipped with a colossal metal locker facility.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.080
It is a tanker armed with an explosive catapult.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:56.760
Hey, I bet we could use that one in battle.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:01.930
At the moment, it is our most likely candidate for modification.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:06.020
That leaves just this ship, the Multidimensional Intelligence Ship...

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:07.060
Correct.

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:11.230
Due to the fact that it was built to excel at intelligence-gathering and...

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.770
...covert investigations, it was not equipped it with flight capabilities.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:16.480
What's it armed with, submersible missiles?

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.280
Correct.

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:21.200
In addition, it will be possible to add a wide array of weaponry to the...

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:24.910
...emergency escape jet, Fly One, docked to the front of this craft.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:29.000
Okay, we should propose deploying Fly One in the event of an air battle.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.630
I take it you're still brooding over the Zonder Metal production plant...

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:34.080
...we discovered the other day?

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.170
Yeah...

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:37.500
We can't let those things crop up all over the place...

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:41.010
...or there'll be unlimited Zonders no matter how hard we fight.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:44.390
And also, it worries me to think about the Zonders' ultimate goals.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:49.810
The Zonders have the ability to amplify the inner hatred of their...

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:51.890
...human hosts and put that hatred into action.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:56.110
It was a personal grievance that led EI-02 to advance on the downtown...

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:59.070
...area transforming into a robot solely to destroy City Hall.

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:04.280
Had EI-02 managed to fulfill his goal, what would have happened?

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:06.990
The same goes for the other Zonders.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:11.250
If that Shuttle Robot had achieved his objective and blasted off into...

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:13.210
...space what on Earth would have happened?

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:18.750
When I infiltrated the Zonder that only seemed to be floating in the...

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:21.800
...sky like a cloud I saw a Zonder core on the brink of fulfilling its...

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.880
...goal and it was a strange sight to behold.

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:46.740
It looked like it was about to fire nuclear missiles at every city on Earth.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:50.370
Right now, the Mobile Unit just doesn't have enough firepower...

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:52.370
...to destroy the Zonders' ambition!

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.870
I, too, shall fight if it comes to that.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:59.090
But you're a robot built to specialize in intelligence-gathering.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:00.750
You have a critical task...

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:03.090
...protecting Mamoru. I can't have you forgetting that!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:04.340
Right.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:08.220
Volfogg, of the GGG Intelligence Unit...

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:12.310
A Super-A.I. Vehicle Robot built in the utmost secrecy...

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:16.900
There are many secret aspects of Volfogg that remain classified.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:20.150
Even if the outlook of the battle becomes grim...

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:23.570
...let us hope we won't have to use the ultimate projectile, Bullet X.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:44.340
Hey, that black robot's name is GaoGaiGar, you know!

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:48.800
I mean, I was actually rescued by a secret government defense force...

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:49.970
...more than once!

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:52.810
Darn that Takayasu, he got all his info from me!

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:55.600
What, you sure it's okay?

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.900
Yeah! Up to four people can go.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:00.150
And there's only three people in my family.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:04.440
Wow, last week I was in Hokkaido, and next week I'll be in Okinawa!

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:08.030
It's like I'm taking a gourmet road trip all across Japan!

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.410
Waha! What are you talking about?

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:11.490
You know what?

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:12.990
While I was at my grandma's I remembered...

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:17.500
...all those times you and I played together when we were little!

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:18.960
Do you remember?

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.590
That snowy day when we ate rice cakes together?

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:24.210
Yeah. Wasn't that when we were like, five?

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:27.880
You haven't forgotten what we promised each other, have you?

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.550
No, I haven't forgotten...

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:34.350
I haven't forgotten...

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:51.450
I hope you realize just what we're up against, Pizza...

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:52.950
Of course I do.

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:57.540
The black robot, so powerful he can penetrate our Zonder barrier...

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.080
...GaoGaiGar.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.210
Those blue and red robots...

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:09.010
...equipped with both a flamethrower and a freezing rifle...

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:19.480
And the single high-powered robot they transform into can use...

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:23.310
...energy to instantly redirect flames and explosions into space...

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:30.030
There's also a mysterious robot who's somehow able to move...

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:32.410
...around even in the midst of powerful electromagnetic waves.

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:35.280
Do you still think it's going to be an easy task to eliminate them?

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.370
I never had much interest in them to begin with.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.460
What we need to focus on is that child.

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:46.550
The power to transform Zonders back into their human forms...

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.960
...is for us, a threat we cannot ignore.

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.380
And also...

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:53.510
Hyper Mode!

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:03.060
That insolent cyborg...

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:08.110
Don't lose sight of what we're after, Pizza.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:09.570
I won't...

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:12.030
Of course I won't, Penchinon.

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:14.320
Overwriting all battle data.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:16.870
Simulation, preparations complete!

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.120
Okay!

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:21.290
She sells sea shells by the Triple- decked Flying Carrier, launch!

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:45.650
DrillGao, ready for deployment!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:49.480
All right!

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:53.900
HyoRyu, EnRyu! Prepare to open fire in front of Gate No. 3!

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:57.620
GaiGar...

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:01.250
...now equipped with StealthGao, DrillGao, fusion complete!

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:07.580
EnRyu, Melting Gun and Rifle, open automatic fire!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:08.540
Roger!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:11.260
Let's go, let's go, let's go!

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:17.840
Next, HyoRyu, Freezing Gun and Rife, open automatic fire!

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:18.800
Roger!

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:21.520
Minus 150 degrees Celsius, 170, 190, 200, 210...

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:28.360
Mobility 22% down, defensive power 46% up!

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:32.400
They may have lost speed, but now they're a lot tougher!

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:37.360
I'd like to test out their supermechanoid durability next.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:39.950
All right! Final Fusion, approved!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.030
Roger!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:42.580
Final Fusion...

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:44.370
Program...

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:46.920
...Drive!

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:52.550
Final Fusion!

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.800
Dividing Driver... ready to launch!

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.760
Now opening the Mirror Catapult!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:24.160
GaoGaiGar!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.210
Coordinates locked down!

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:33.300
Commencing Mirror Coating!

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:36.050
Launch!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:57.440
Dividing Driver!

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:06.830
Generating Battlefield!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.120
HyoRyu, EnRyu, stand by!

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.330
Commencing Mirror Coating...

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.340
Launch!

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:22.010
The Mirror Coating repulses energy creating an instantaneous...

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:26.720
...repulsion field within the Mirror Catapult launching the...

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:31.310
...mirror-coated object in the manner of same-pole magnetic repulsion.

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:42.280
SympaRate, 100%!

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:45.330
Symmetrical Docking, approved!

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:48.830
Symmetrical Docking!

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:19.530
ChoRyuJin!

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:36.380
In terms of power, ChoRyuJin is overwhelming GaoGaiGar!

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:39.920
ChoRyuJin! Don't hold anything back! Pulverize him!

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:41.340
Roger!

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:43.260
Double Gun!

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:51.350
Both your arms are blocked, so you can't attack or defend yourself.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:52.640
What are you gonna do now, GaoGaiGar?

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:08.990
Burning Inner Strength!

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:16.330
Okay! That's it for today's battle simulation, guys.

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:21.760
Hey Mamoru, tomorrow's the big day, huh?

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:22.760
I guess so...

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:25.260
It's really hot in Okinawa, isn't it?

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:26.590
I guess so...

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:29.890
Hey Mamoru, all you've been saying is "I guess so!"

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:31.100
I guess so...

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:36.440
No need to fear a mere child.

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:41.070
There is only one thing capable of wielding any impact on mankind...

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:43.570
...and that is the Legacy of Cain.

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:46.030
That is true...

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:49.450
If we can just get rid of that MechaLion...

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:53.700
...GaoGaiGar won't be able to reach his final form!

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:59.040
Zonder Metal and the G-Stone are antiparticles, so to speak.

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:02.630
If both substances were to collide at full power...

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:05.800
...then there'd be no tomorrow for mankind, no, for the entire planet!

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:09.640
I can't sleep...

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:10.890
What's the matter?

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:14.720
Are you nervous because tomorrow we go to Okinawa for our vacation?

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:16.140
No, that's not it...

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:20.520
I was thinking, if that North Pole Lion shows up again...

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:26.490
...he's going to take Mamoru away from us for sure this time!

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:28.740
Oh, you're such a worrywart, Ai.

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:32.030
No worries! It's warm down in Okinawa.

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:34.240
That North Pole Lion isn't going to show up there.

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:35.450
Are you sure?

00:22:35.540 --> 00:22:36.370
Of course!

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:38.500
You're right...

00:22:39.370 --> 00:22:41.630
Let's think about it tomorrow...

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:46.230 --> 00:23:49.530
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:49.690 --> 00:23:52.660
The Four Machine Kings prepare to launch a dastardly plot...

00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:55.280
...as Mamoru enjoys a day off at the Okinawa Waterpolis.

00:23:55.580 --> 00:23:59.700
Volfogg of the Intelligence Unit, you must protect Mamoru!

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:03.540
But it's really Galeon whom the enemy is after...

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:05.880
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:07.250
"The Legacy of Cain"

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:10.470
The Legacy of Cain

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:10.590
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.470 --> 00:24:15.430
Silvercross

00:24:13.510 --> 00:24:15.260
This is the Key to Victory!
